sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant T as A tool with a huge result
    participant B as Backend (filesystem)
    A->>T: tool call
    T-->>A: 200k-token response
    Note over A,B: automatic — result exceeds ~20k tokens
    A->>B: write the full result to a file
    B-->>A: short preview + file path in the conversation
    A->>B: read_file later, only if the details are needed
